  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to resolve the unusual situation where FedoraVersioning.addVersion(..) fails.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Sometimes the update from \"versionService.createVersion(..)\", which adds the \"mix:versionable\" if necessary (line:152), is not available before the subsequent request for \"resource().getBaseVersion().getFrozenNode()\" is made (line:154).",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraVersioning.java#L152-L154"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraVersioning.java#L152-L154",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "See: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://groups.google.com/d/msg/fedora-tech/IpcKRY2IqJI/secreM_CAwAJ"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://groups.google.com/d/msg/fedora-tech/IpcKRY2IqJI/secreM_CAwAJ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
