  "description": "<p>This task is to resolve the unusual situation where FedoraVersioning.addVersion(..) fails.</p>\n\n<p>Sometimes the update from \"versionService.createVersion(..)\", which adds the \"mix:versionable\" if necessary (line:152), is not available before the subsequent request for \"resource().getBaseVersion().getFrozenNode()\" is made (line:154).<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraVersioning.java#L152-L154\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraVersioning.java#L152-L154</a></p>\n\n<p>See: <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/fedora-tech/IpcKRY2IqJI/secreM_CAwAJ\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://groups.google.com/d/msg/fedora-tech/IpcKRY2IqJI/secreM_CAwAJ</a></p>",
